    "body": "Horizon Harness 1.0.0\n\nTerminal AI agent with streaming responses, tool activity, persistent sessions, model configuration, message queues, and English / Chinese / Japanese interfaces.\n\nNative bundles include the Python runtime. Supported targets: macOS Apple Silicon, macOS Intel, and Windows x64. All three CI builds and bundle checks passed.\n\nmacOS installation:\n```sh\ncurl -fsSL https://github.com/01ny-yzx/horizon-harness/releases/latest/download/install.sh | sh\n```\n\nInstall with npm (Node.js 18+):\n```sh\nnpm install -g horizon-harness\nhorizon\n```\n\nmacOS Homebrew:\n```sh\nbrew install 01ny-yzx/tap/horizon\n```\n\nAlternatively, download the archive for your platform below.\n",
